#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:delivery_shipstation.view_delivery_carrier_form
msgid ""
"In your ShipStation account, go to <b>Settings &gt; Account &gt; Shipping "
"&gt; Carriers</b> and use the On/Off toggle on the carrier list to enable "
"the ones you need.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ໃນບັນຊີ ShipStation ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ &gt; ບັນຊີ &gt; ການຈັດສົ່ງ &gt; ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິກາ"
"ນຂົນສົ່ງ</b> ແລະ ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ ເປີດ/ປິດ ໃນລາຍການຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງ ເພື່ອເປີດນຳໃຊ້ອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນ.<br/>"

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_shipstation.field_delivery_carrier__shipstation_insurance_provider
msgid "Indicates a preferred insurance provider for your shipment."
msgstr "ລະບຸຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການປະກັນໄພທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບການຈັດສົ່ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_shipstation.field_delivery_carrier__shipstation_confirmation_type
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of delivery confirmation you want for your shipment. The "
"available options depend on the carrier and service you choose."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸປະເພດການຢືນຢັນການຈັດສົ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບການຈັດສົ່ງຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່"
"ງ ແລະ ການບໍລິການທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_shipstation/models/shipstation_request.py:0
msgid "Length, Width, and Height is necessary for a ShipStation Package."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວ, ຄວາມກວ້າງ, ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບພັດສະດຸ ShipStation."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:delivery_shipstation.selection__delivery_carrier__shipstation_label_layout__letter
msgid "Letter"
msgstr "Letter"

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/delivery_shipstation/static/src/components/shipstation_selection_dialog.xml:0
msgid "Multi-Package"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍພັດສະດຸ"

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_shipstation/models/delivery_carrier.py:0
msgid ""
"No carrier is set on \"%(delivery_method)s\". To use ShipStation, you'll "
"need to sync your carriers with your account."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງໃນ \"%(delivery_method)s\". ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ ShipStation, ທ່ານຈຳເ"
"ປັນຕ້ອງຊິງຄ໌ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງຂອງທ່ານກັບບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_shipstation/models/shipstation_request.py:0
msgid "No label reference found on the picking. Unable to cancel shipment."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງປ້າຍກຳກັບໃນໃບເບີກສິນຄ້າ. ບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກການຈັດສົ່ງໄດ້."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_shipstation/models/shipstation_request.py:0
msgid ""
"No label reference found on the picking. Unable to create return shipment."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງປ້າຍກຳກັບໃນໃບເບີກສິນຄ້າ. ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງການສົ່ງຄືນສິນຄ້າໄດ້."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:delivery_shipstation.view_delivery_carrier_form
msgid ""
"Once generated, copy the <b>Production Key</b>, as it is required on the "
"delivery method configuration in Odoo.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາເອົາ <b>Production Key</b>, ເນື່ອງຈາກຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າວິທີກາ"
"ນຈັດສົ່ງໃນ Odoo.<br/>"

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:delivery_shipstation.view_delivery_carrier_form
msgid ""
"Once your account is created, go to <b>Settings &gt; Account &gt; API "
"Settings</b>, select the <b>V2 API</b> and click <b>Generate API "
"Key</b>.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ &gt; ບັນຊີ &gt; ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ API</b>, ເລືອກ <b>"
"V2 API</b> ແລະ ຄລິກ <b>Generate API Key</b>.<br/>"

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_shipstation/models/delivery_carrier.py:0
msgid "Only system administrators can sync ShipStation carriers."
msgstr ""
"ສະເພາະຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດຊິງຄ໌ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງ ShipStation ໄດ້."

#. module: delivery_shipstation
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:delivery_shipstation.selection__delivery_carrier__shipstation_label_file_type__pdf
